# Security headers — brand InfoSec / vendor-scan readiness.
# (Content-Security-Policy is intentionally NOT here yet: the app loads many third-party
#  origins — Leaflet CDN, map tiles, Google Fonts, GetYourGuide/Viator widgets, PostHog,
#  Wikimedia/Unsplash/Flickr images — so CSP is being built + tested separately to avoid
#  breaking the map or the tour widgets.)
# No X-Frame-Options: the app is an intentionally embeddable widget (hotels embed it).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  # Allow large image previews in Search / Discover (thumbnail-size directive; does NOT force indexing).
  X-Robots-Tag: max-image-preview:large

# Keep demo / sample surfaces out of search engines.
# (More-specific X-Robots-Tag below wins for these paths, so they stay noindex.)
/demo/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/p/demo
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
